    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_1_q", "label": "Q1", "default": "What tire brands does Prince Tires carry in Calgary?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_1_a", "label": "A1", "default": "We stock 26 tire and wheel brands at our 111 42 Ave SW Calgary location. Top sellers include Michelin, Bridgestone, BFGoodrich, Toyo, Yokohama, Mickey Thompson, Continental, Cooper, Firestone, Kumho, and General Tire. Value lines include Radar, Rovelo, Tesche, and Cargomax." },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_2_q", "label": "Q2", "default": "Do you carry budget tire brands?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_2_a", "label": "A2", "default": "Yes. Radar, Rovelo, Tesche, and Cargomax cover the under-$150-per-tire range in common sizes. Every budget tire we install passes the same balance, torque, and TPMS reset as a premium tire — we don't cut corners based on what you paid." },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_3_q", "label": "Q3", "default": "Do you price-match other Calgary tire shops?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_3_a", "label": "A3", "default": "Yes. Show us a written quote on the same tire from another Calgary tire shop and we will match it. The match applies to in-stock equivalents; out-of-stock or special orders are handled on a case-by-case basis." },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_4_q", "label": "Q4", "default": "Are all the tires you list actually in stock?" },
    { "type": "textarea" ,"id": "faq_4_a", "label": "A4", "default": "Most sizes in our top brands are in stock at 111 42 Ave SW. If a tire is on order, we will tell you up front and quote a realistic ETA — usually next business day from our Calgary supplier, or up to 5 days for special-order imports." },
