    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_10_a", "label": "A10", "default": "Yes for common BMW, Mini, and Lexus run-flat sizes — typically Bridgestone, Michelin, and Continental run-flats. Less-common sizes are usually next-day from our Calgary supplier. Call (403) 452-4283 with your size and we will confirm availability before you come in." },
